    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>消费，一定程度上代表着人们对美好生活的向往，于是，我们对于购买的物品赋予意义与期望，但并不是每次消费都是理性与划算的，这代表消费总是会事与愿违，没有带来我们期待的效果。本期节目，三位主播分享了过去一年购买过的值得买（红榜）与不值得买（黑榜）物件，主要涉及数码产品与家电，不妨一听。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>红黑榜上榜消费品：</span></h2><span></span><ul><span></span><li><span>Apple Pencil</span></li><span></span><li><span>空气炸锅</span></li><span></span><li><span>Surface Mobile Mouse</span></li><span></span><li><span>折叠键盘</span></li><span></span><li><span>烤箱</span></li><span></span><li><span>Dell Vostro 5310&nbsp;</span></li><span></span><li><span>Windows 11</span></li><span></span><li><span>iOS15 bug</span></li><span></span><li><span>电热毛巾架</span></li><span></span><li><span>手机无线充电器</span></li><span></span><li><span>iPad Pro 2021</span></li><span></span><li><span>M1 MacBook Air</span></li><span></span><li><span>Netflix会员</span></li><span></span><li><span>Homepod Mini</span></li><span></span><li><span>Sony 85x 95J</span></li><span></span><li><span>13套洗碗机</span></li><span></span><li><span>石头 G10扫地机器人</span></li><span></span><li><span>电磁炉</span></li><span></span><li><span>头发干洗喷雾</span></li><span></span><li><span>《一把刀千个字》王安忆</span></li><span></span><li><span>《巴比伦柏林》</span></li><span></span><li><span>原神 </span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>主持：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>王隐</span></p><span></span><p><span>敬礼</span></p><span></span><h2><span>嘉宾：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>欧阳洋葱（微博</span><a href="https://weibo.com/illumi" data-url="https://weibo.com/illumi"><span>@_欧阳洋葱</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><h2><span>Playlist：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Beautiful Ones – Suede</span></p><span></span><h2><span>联系我们：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>你可以通过邮件向我们反馈节目中的问题和建议：&nbsp;</span><a href="mailto://hi@webview.tech"><span>hi@webview.tech</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/7159686921" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/7159686921"><span>@WEB VIEW播客</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>我们的网站：&nbsp;</span><a href="https://webview.tech/" data-url="https://webview.tech/"><span>webview.tech</span></a></p>]]></description>
