    <guid isPermaLink="false">615652da5c5d3aaf1d5b9fed</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 01 Oct 2021 00:00:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近《鱿鱼游戏》大火，本期节目我们就拿它来开头，讲讲其背后视频平台网飞相比国内视频网站到底好在哪，顺便推荐一下我们看过还不错的网飞冷门佳片。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>SHOWNOTE：</span></h2><span></span><ul><span></span><li><span>当下特火的《鱿鱼游戏》的故事设定来自哪个原始母题？</span></li><span></span><li><span>为什么王隐认为《鱿鱼游戏》类影视作品的设定普遍很假？</span></li><span></span><li><span>好的片子一定需要限制性镜头吗？限制性镜头也内卷了吗？</span></li><span></span><li><span>看网飞之后，自己看片子的标准有了怎样的改变？</span></li><span></span><li><span>Chrome 网飞看评分插件： Popcorn – Ratings for Netflix</span></li><span></span><li><span>网飞对比国内视频平台的优势有哪些？</span></li><span></span><li><span>一个北影节笑话</span></li><span></span><li><span>国产片哪里不好？</span></li><span></span><li><span>看电影前看豆瓣评分的弊端有哪些？</span></li><span></span><li><span>为什么恐怖、惊悚、悬疑犯罪普遍豆瓣评分很低？</span></li><span></span><li><span>宗教、成仙的概念分别对中、外观众的接受度为什么如此高？</span></li><span></span><li><span>网飞冷门佳片推荐</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>节目中提到的影片</span></h2><span></span><ul><span></span><li><span>《鱿鱼游戏》</span></li><span></span><li><span>《致命感应》</span></li><span></span><li><span>《欺诈游戏》</span></li><span></span><li><span>《弥留之国的爱丽丝》 </span></li><span></span><li><span>《缉魂》</span></li><span></span><li><span>《双瞳》</span></li><span></span><li><span>《中邪》</span></li><span></span><li><span>《科明斯基理论》</span></li><span></span><li><span>《后半生》</span></li><span></span><li><span>《全能侦探社》</span></li><span></span><li><span>《拉契特》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>主持：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>王隐</span></p><span></span><p><span>敬礼</span></p><span></span><h2><span>Playlist：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Beautiful Ones – Suede</span></p><span></span><h2><span>联系我们：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>你可以通过邮件向我们反馈节目中的问题和建议：&nbsp;</span><a href="mailto://hi@webview.tech"><span>hi@webview.tech</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/7159686921" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/7159686921"><span>@WEB VIEW播客</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>我们的网站：&nbsp;</span><a href="https://webview.tech/" data