  <item>
    <title>32. Mac换芯，换新Mac？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/5fb076d783c34e85ddece297</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">5fb076d783c34e85ddece297</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>11月11日，苹果发布首批自研芯片Mac，对于普通消费者的影响力或许没有iPhone大，但对于行业几乎失效的摩尔定律，苹果好像起到了鲶鱼般的推进作用。这当然离不开它强大的软硬件、上下游整合能力，这也是微软、英特尔阵营目前缺乏的关键能力。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目带你回顾苹果发布会上的Mac新品及我们的关注重点：M1芯片。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>SHOWNOTE：</span></h2><span></span><ul><span></span><li><span>MacBook Air</span><ul><span></span><li><span>砍掉风扇，Air 还能当工作站吗？</span></li><span></span><li><span>屏幕补上 P3 色域，看中轻薄的创作者用户可以考虑了吗？</span></li><span></span><li><span>雷电接口仍保留，和 Intel 的和平分手？</span></li><span></span><li><span>GPU 阉割，但游戏还能玩？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span></li><span></span><li><span>MacBook Pro</span><ul><span></span><li><span>芯片、内存和 Air 都一样，还有必要买 Pro 吗？</span></li><span></span><li><span>13寸的 Pro，最高选配 16G，SoC 封装真的装不下？</span></li><span></span><li><span>推出 M1 芯片的同时，为什么也保留了Intel 版本？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span></li><span></span><li><span>Mac mini</span><ul><span></span><li><span>DIY 玩家面临的 SoC 内存危机</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><ul><span></span><li><strong><span>苹果自研的M1芯片（本期重点）</span></strong><span></span><ul><span></span><li><span>发布会大数字：夸张，还是确有其事？</span></li><span></span><li><span>M1 VS Tigerlake（Intel 11代酷睿）</span></li><span></span><li><span>M1 VS AMD Zen</span></li><span></span><li><span>制程：M1 5nm VS 台积电 7nm VS Intel 10nm</span></li><span></span><li><span>能效比：功耗和性能的线性提升？大小核？</span></li><span></span><li><span>统一内存架构：比 AMD 更大胆的推行策略？（微架构）</span></li><span></span><li><span>上下游生态整合：专用单元 VS 通用单元（微架构）</span></li><span></span><li><span>8-wide 的 Decoder（微架构） </span></li><span></span><li><span>M1 准备好面向高端领域了吗？</span></li><span></span><li><span>普通用户选购，需要担忧软件适配吗？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>2020苹果发布会相关节目：</span></h2><span></span><ul><span></span><li><span>10 月 iPhone：</span><a href="https://webview.tech/1998/" data-url="https://webview.tech/1998/"><span>31. 中大杯苹果，加量又加价</span></a></li><span></span><li><span>9 月 iPad：</span><a href="https://webview.tech/1987/" data-url="https://webview.tech/1987/"><span>30. 片儿汤话01：揪心的iPad和漫长的垃圾分类</span></a></li><span></span><li><span>6 月 WWDC：</span><a href="https://webview.tech/1878/" data-url="https://webview.tech/1878/"><span>28. WWDC20：在Mac上玩荒野乱斗</span></a></li><span></span><li><span>3 月 iPad Pro 及妙控键盘：</span><a href="https://webview.tech/1805/" data-url="https://webview.tech/1805/"><span>26. 新发布的 iPad Pro + 妙控键盘比 Mac 还贵，选谁？</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>主持：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>王隐</span></p><span></span><h2><span>嘉宾：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>欧阳洋葱（微博</span><a href="https://weibo.com/illumi" data-url="https://weibo.com/illumi"><span>@_欧阳洋葱</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><h2><span>Playlist：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Beautiful Ones – Suede</span></p><span></span><h2><span>联系我们：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>你可以通过邮件向我们反馈节目中的问题和建议：&nbsp;</span><a href="mailto://hi@webview.tech"><span>hi@webview.tech</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/7159686921" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/7159686921"><span>@WEB VIEW播客</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>我们的网站：&nbsp;</span><a href="https://webview.tech/" data-url="https://webview.tech/"><span>webview.tech</span></a></p>]]></description>
