    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>应试环境下的英语学习，其实很难让我们熟练掌握「听说读写」，而且随着DeepL等神经网络技术的进步，英文阅读的门槛也越来越低。那毕业后的我们，还有必要继续背单词（abandon）吗？</span></p><span></span><h2><span>SHOWNOTE：</span></h2><span></span><ul><span></span><li><span>哪些行业，首选要看英文资源？</span></li><span></span><li><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/26852425/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/26852425/"><span>《什么是科学》</span></a><span>—吴国盛</span></li><span></span><li><span>中英文语言对比，谁的信息传递效率更高？</span></li><span></span><li><a href="https://sspai.com/post/53911" data-url="https://sspai.com/post/53911"><span>《谈中英文字间距》</span></a><span>—王隐</span></li><span></span><li><span>英文原版书籍翻译质量不好，什么原因？</span></li><span></span><li><span>英文的中心词前置，好处是什么？</span></li><span></span><li><span>一门语言的强势，有哪些评价标准？</span></li><span></span><li><span>DeepL、Google translate 技术的出现，还有学英语的必要吗？</span></li><span></span><li><span>应试教育下的学英语，有什么问题？</span></li><span></span><li><span>如何评估自己的英语水平？</span></li><span></span><li><span>进外企，英语要达到什么水平？</span></li><span></span><li><span>实在学不会英语，怎么办？</span></li><span></span><li><span>彩蛋：如何速成科技圈「专业术语」正确发音</span><ul><span></span><li><span>Safari</span></li><span></span><li><span>Chrome</span></li><span></span><li><span>Adobe</span></li><span></span><li><span>Skype</span></li><span></span><li><span>Azure</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>主持：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>王隐</span></p><span></span><h2><span>嘉宾：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>欧阳洋葱（微博</span><a href="https://weibo.com/illumi" data-url="https://weibo.com/illumi"><span>@_欧阳洋葱</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><h2><span>Playlist：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Beautiful Ones – Suede</span></p><span></span><h2><span>联系我们：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>你可以通过邮件向我们反馈节目中的问题和建议：&nbsp;</span><a href="mailto://hi@webview.tech"><span>hi@webview.tech</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/7159686921" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/7159686921"><span>@WEB VIEW播客</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>我们的网站：&nbsp;</span><a href="https://webview.tech/" data-url="https://webview.tech/"><span>webview.tech</span></a></p><p></p>]]></description>
